      "content": "hey i'm working on a predictive model for residential property theft for my firm. looking at some zip code data for a specific region and noticing some big shifts in the demographics over the last 5 years—mostly increases in certain minority ethnic groups. i'm trying to figure out if these changes in ethnic composition are a significant statistical predictor for the rising larceny rates we're seeing in those areas. can you help me look at how to weight these demographic variables in a risk model?",
